/// Bed operations — no PHI exposure per ADR-0016 gate 4.
/// Filter grammar: row is visible iff `_data_quality != "phi"`. Rows tagged as
/// PHI by silver Gate 2 sweep never reach this role's queries. Sprint 10 M3-A
/// re-authors the 4 roles that Sprint 09 lost via Fabric portal round-trip.
role BedOps
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission encounter = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)

	tablePermission bed_assignment = IF([_data_quality] = "phi", FALSE, TRUE)

	member 'admin@mngenvmcap164444.onmicrosoft.com'
